OL,3,GNEWSACandles to remember loved ones at
OL,4,Achurch and quay
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of candles will be lit in
OL,7,Fmemory of loved ones as part of events
OL,8,Fto raise money for a bereavement
OL,9,Fsupport charity.
OL,11,FThe lanterns, fitted with with LED
OL,12,Flights, carry personal messages to
OL,13,Freflect, remember and celebrate friends
OL,14,Fand family before they are placed
OL,15,Ftogether to form a large display.
