OL,3,GNEWSACandles to remember loved ones at
OL,4,Achurch and quay
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe remembrance evenings are being held
OL,7,Fby Lewis-Manning Hospice Care to raise
OL,8,Fmoney for its counselling service. The
OL,9,FPoole-based charity provides free care
OL,10,Fand support for people with a
OL,11,Flife-limiting illness, their carers and
OL,12,Floved ones.
OL,14,FThe events in Swanage at St Mary's
OL,15,FChurch on Thursday from 17:30 - 19:00
OL,16,FGMT and at Poole Quay on 26 November,
OL,17,Ffrom 16:00 - 20:00.
